# .trivyignore
# Explicitly accepted vulnerabilities that cannot be fixed by this project.
# Each entry is documented with the reason so this file is auditable.
# Review and remove entries as new base images / upstream packages are released.

# zlib CVE in node:24-alpine base OS layer.
# Alpine has released a fix (1.3.2-r0) but the node:24-alpine Docker image
# has not yet been rebuilt with the patched packages. Remove once a new
# node:24-alpine image ships with zlib >= 1.3.2-r0.
CVE-2026-22184

# minimatch CVEs in npm's own bundled internal packages
# (usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/...). These are NOT in our application
# dependencies — they are part of the npm CLI bundled inside the Node.js
# Docker image. We have no control over them; they are fixed upstream in
# newer npm releases. Remove once node:24-alpine ships a patched npm version.
CVE-2026-26996
CVE-2026-27903
CVE-2026-27904

# tar CVEs in npm's own bundled internal packages (same reason as minimatch).
CVE-2026-26960
CVE-2026-29786
CVE-2026-31802
